VERSION 1.2.0
-------------

NEW FEATURES

    o Implement ZarrSparseMatrix objects. Analog to H5SparseMatrix and
      TENxMatrix objects from the HDF5Array package but for Zarr-based
      sparse matrices instead of HDF5-based.
      Co-authored-by: Artur-man <artur-man@hotmail.com>

    o Add writeZarrSparseMatrix() for realizing a matrix-like object
      (typically sparse) as a ZarrSparseMatrix object.

    o Add a new set of get/set_Zarr_realization_*() functions for
      controlling Zarr realization settings. They replace the
      old get/set_writeZarrArray_*() functions.

    o Add support for bfloat and enable more Rarr test cases (#13).
      Authored by Hugo Gruson <git@hugogruson.fr>

SIGNIFICANT USER-VISIBLE CHANGES

    o The default value for writeZarrArray()'s automatic arguments now
      is "auto" instead of NULL.

    o writeZarrArray()'s argument 'zarr_version' now is an automatic argument.

DEPRECATED AND DEFUNCT

    o Deprecate all the get/set_writeZarrArray_*() functions in favor of
      the new get/set_Zarr_realization_*() functions.


VERSION 1.0.0
-------------

    o First version of the package that is ready for general use.

